                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, the @HouseCommerce  Committee passed @RepDanCrenshaw\u2019s legislation reauthorizing the Children\u2019s Hospitals Graduate Medical Education payment program. I am a cosponsor of this bill.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nI find it deeply troubling that some in the children\u2019s medical field are pushing destructive treatments -- such as gender altering surgeries and puberty blocking drugs \u2013 on boys and girls.\u00a0 That is why this reauthorization of funds will go only to hospitals NOT\u00a0performing these types of procedures. I will not support sending taxpayer dollars to hospitals performing these permanent, life-altering procedures on children.",
